sequenceDiagram
  participant Caller as Internal caller
  participant Controller as ML Controller
  participant Handler as RunPredictions.Handler
  participant Strategy as Strategy factory
  participant Unified as Unified NCM V1
  participant Global as Global return-customer model
  participant EventHub as Audit writer

  Caller->>Controller: POST /machinelearning-gateway/predictions
  Controller->>Handler: MediatR command
  Handler->>Strategy: Select models from request shape
  Strategy-->>Handler: Unified NCM V1 + optional Global Return Customer
  par Selected model execution
      Handler->>Unified: Invoke unified Databricks path
      Unified-->>Handler: ModelCallAttempt
  and Optional second model
      Handler->>Global: Invoke decorated Databricks path
      Global-->>Handler: ModelCallAttempt
  end
  Handler->>Handler: Aggregate attempts into MachineLearningGatewayResult
  opt Best-effort audit side effect
      Handler->>EventHub: Publish MachineLearningRunPredictionsCompleted
      EventHub-->>Handler: Success or logged failure
  end
  Handler-->>Controller: Gateway result
  Controller-->>Caller: HTTP response
